<title>DENMARK: Danish cbank sells full 3.0 bln of 4.0% pct T-bill.</title>
<headline>Danish cbank sells full 3.0 bln of 4.0% pct T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's central bank sold its full three billion crown offer of the new four percent treasury bill in the opening minutes of Tuesday's auction, a dealer said.</p>
</text>
